# Build context for intake-api/Dockerfile is the repo root (it needs sibling ../scanner/src and
# ../contracts too), so a plain ".dockerignore" here would sit outside the context root and be
# ignored. Docker/BuildKit looks for "<path-to-dockerfile>.dockerignore" in the context root instead
# (see the Dockerfile reference, "multiple Dockerfiles"); naming it intake-api/Dockerfile.dockerignore
# is how this directory ships one without touching anything outside intake-api/.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.md
intake-api/src/test
scanner/src/test
.git
